    teacher: "Churches differ in their style, so avoid favouring one. Help learners to appreciate other traditions and to see both reverence and joy in Scripture. Be sensitive to cultural expressions of worship and the personalities of learners.",
    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners why worship needs both reverence and joy.",
    mcq1: ["What does Psalm 2:11 say?", ["Serve the Lord with fear, and rejoice with trembling", "Only be joyful", "Only be afraid", "Serve no one"], 0, "Fear and rejoicing are joined."],
    mcq2: ["What does Psalm 100:2 say?", ["Serve the Lord with gladness", "Serve with sorrow", "Serve in silence only", "Serve for money"], 0, "Serve with gladness."],
