    sa: ["Why does biblical worship need both reverence and joy?", ["reverence", "joy", "god", "holy", "gladness", "awe"], "A good answer says God is both majestic and good, so worship holds awe at his holiness together with gladness in his grace, avoiding irreverence and joyless formality."],
